-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- BOOKING QUESTIONS FOR THE FOUR SERVICES
--
-- Every question and every answer option lives here rather than in the React
-- code. Adding "Pergola Waterproofing" is then one INSERT and no deploy, and
-- an admin screen over this table is a normal CRUD form.
--
-- Note what is NOT here: no question asks who supplies the material.
-- Supplybase supplies it, per the quotation, and asking implies a choice the
-- customer does not have.
--
-- question_key groups rows into one question; input_type says how to draw it:
--   SINGLE  one choice        MULTI   several choices
--   TEXT    free text         NUMBER  a number
--   FILE    upload control
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

